/F2 15 Tf 50 740 Td (Voice Controlled Object Detection Robot - Hardware & Principle) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 0 -14 Td (Yameen Sayyad  |  Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning) Tj
50 715 m 560 715 l S
/F2 13 Tf 50 690 Td (4. HARDWARE SPECIFICATIONS) Tj
/F2 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (1. Arduino Uno Microcontroller (Brain of System):) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -14 Td (   ATmega328P MCU @ 16 MHz clock, 14 digital I/O pins (6 PWM), 6 analog inputs, 5V operating logic.) Tj
/F2 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (2. L298N Dual H-Bridge Motor Driver Module:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -14 Td (   Controls two DC motors independently. 5V-35V operating range, 2A peak current per channel.) Tj
/F2 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (3. HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Distance Sensor:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -14 Td (   Frequency: 40 kHz, range: 2 cm to 400 cm, accuracy: +/-3 mm, 15-degree measuring angle.) Tj
/F2 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (4. HC-05 Bluetooth Serial Module:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -14 Td (   Bluetooth 2.0+EDR standard, UART serial communication at 9600 baud, 10m wireless range.) Tj
/F2 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (5. DC Geared Motors & 12V Power Supply:) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -14 Td (   High-torque DC gear motors paired with rechargeable lithium battery pack for sustained operation.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 0 -32 Td (5. WORKING PRINCIPLE & REACTIVE CONTROL LOOP) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 0 -18 Td (The system coordinates two concurrent operational routines:) Tj
0 -14 Td (1. Voice Control Mode: Smartphone app converts speech to text tokens transmitted over Bluetooth.) Tj
0 -14 Td (   Arduino reads serial characters and commands motor driver pins for directional steering.) Tj
0 -14 Td (2. Obstacle Avoidance Mode: Ultrasonic Trig pin fires 10us acoustic pulse; Echo pin measures bounce.) Tj
0 -14 Td (   Distance = (Echo Time * Speed of Sound) / 2. If Distance < 20 cm, Arduino stops motors immediately.) Tj
0 -14 Td (Safety Override: Even if user shouts 'Forward', the robot refuses movement until obstacle is removed.) Tj
ET
endstream
